{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022210052150-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022210658\"/><p>案發於河口湖町一間酒店。（電視畫面）</p><p>日本富士河口湖町酒店名案台灣女死者與疑兇在社交平台互相追蹤，似乎早就相識。女死者生前在台南市一間養護中心工作多年，為人有正義感。她原定上月21日赴日旅遊，惟當天上午在台南高鐵站準備搭車前往桃園機場時，疑因低血糖暈眩不慎落軌擦傷而取消行程。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T13:21:40.179646+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:00:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:57:59.261751+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T13:17:43.756488+00:00","content_hash":"826efe7aa1f0d52030574dcecb3273b720325167aee03c9af161a9b2c50de15d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T13:21:40.179646+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}